## Key Concepts
- CKNE-to-throughput mapping and floor guarantees
- Per-tenant buffering and backpressure
- Dynamic shard/partition weighting and rebalancing cadence
- Observability and safety checks (baseline SLA enforcement)

## Code Example
```javascript
function computeQuota(ckne, baseRate) {
  const rate = Math.max(baseRate, baseRate * (1 + 0.8 * ckne));
  const buffer = Math.ceil((1 - ckne) * 100);
  const shardWeight = ckne;
  return { rate, buffer, shardWeight };
}
```

